# Select Fire Bolt (skill 36, specs/data/calc-expressions.md; server
# body: specs/skills/bodies.md §5, srvmissile) as the right skill and
# cast it at a point. In town the cast is refused (behaviour compared);
# outside town after the runs.
scenario 1
name cast-firebolt
game 1.14d
seed 0x00001234
map 644409375        # the test character's map ID (specs/sim/rng.md §5.4)
difficulty normal
expansion yes
end 300

char class 1
char area 0 1
char at default
char skill 36 1

record s2c rng units stats
snapshot every 25

at 2 msg SelectSkill skill=36 left=0 item=0xFFFFFFFF
at 10 msg RightSkill x=@x+10 y=@y
at 20 msg Run x=@x+30 y=@y
at 60 msg Run x=@x+30 y=@y+10
at 100 msg Run x=@x+30 y=@y+10
at 150 msg RightSkill x=@x+10 y=@y
at 200 msg RightSkill x=@x y=@y+10
